                <h2 class="lock-title">Unlock Your Gaming Rewards Now!</h2>
                <p class="lock-description">Complete one quick offer below to instantly unlock your <strong class="highlight">premium gaming package</strong> worth $99+. Get your rewards in seconds and dominate your favorite games!</p>
                
                <div class="reward-list">
                    <div class="reward-item">
